{
  "id": "vue-node-widgets",
  "capability": "Vue node widget runtime (shared technical module)",
  "description": "Shared technical module, not a business domain. The node widget runtime shared by the Vue node renderer, the classic canvas, linear mode, and the properties panel: the widget-type-to-component registry, generic widget components (number, text, textarea, toggle, select and form dropdown, color, chart, galleria, button, resolution preview, value control, dynamic group rows), the DOM and legacy canvas widget hosts, widget constructors that create LiteGraph widgets from node definitions, remote and asset-backed combo data, promoted-widget resolution, and the PrimitiveNode type guard. Constructors and hosts adapt to the LiteGraph and DOM widget runtime and are integration. The legacy LiteGraph widget layer and widget value contracts belong to node-widgets. Capability widgets already recorded (audio, Markdown, image compare, text preview, bounding boxes, compositor, light, painter) stay with their records.",
